      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does a corner tree bookshelf cost at Wrydeco?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Wrydeco corner tree bookshelves start at $2391.00 for standard 49\"W models. Mid-size 60\"W models start at $2991.00, 75\"W models start at $3783.00, and large 90\"W models start at $4591.00. The collection spans from $2391.00 to $6034.00 depending on overall scale and custom tier requirements."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What sizes are available for Wrydeco corner tree bookshelves?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Standard sizes include 49\"W x 55\"H x 8\"D, 60\"W x 60\"H x 10\"D, 75\"W x 69\"H x 12\"D, and 90\"W x 82\"H x 12\"D. Width reflects the total tip-to-tip span covered by the branches across both corner walls."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What wood finishes can I select for a corner tree bookshelf?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Finishes include Natural, Light Oak, Walnut, Dark Walnut, and Custom. All five finish selections share the same starting price point within each dimensional tier."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can a corner tree bookshelf hold heavy hardcover books?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, models with 10\" and 12\" depths (such as the 60\"W, 75\"W, and 90\"W sizes) are built from solid hardwood to support heavy art volumes and hardcover books when anchored into structural wall studs."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I measure my wall corner for a tree bookshelf?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Measure the open horizontal wall run along both the left and right walls starting from the inside corner vertex. Verify that the combined wall clearance accommodates the unit's width and check that ceiling height exceeds unit height by at least 6 inches."
      }
    }
  ]
